# Darkness Named, the chips (mission.cop.darkness_named#chips). A level 75 Warrior of San d'Oria with 3-5 current and
# Status 2 (GMs). Lower Jeuno, Ghebi Damomohe: the Psoxja Pass held (a GM), the Carmine Chip traded: nothing; the Pass
# gone, two Carmine Chips traded: nothing; a Filthy Gnole Claw traded: nothing; the Cyan Chip: 52; finished: the Psoxja
# Pass, Status 3. Status 2 and the Pass gone (GMs): the Gray Chip: 52; finished: Status 3.
# A Crystalline Prophecy is not current (the default char has its own Lower Jeuno zone-in).
lists LowerJeuno/Ghebi_Damomohe/onTrade LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/52
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=15.5,-0.1,-6.1 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Acp TheEchoAwakens current       # A Crystalline Prophecy's own Lower Jeuno zone-in is off
mission Cop DarknessNamed current
charvar Mission[6][358]Status 2         # a GM
keyitem PsoxjaPass                      # a GM
item CarmineChip x3
item FilthyGnoleClaw
item CyanChip
item GrayChip
login
trade Ghebi_Damomohe CarmineChip x1     # the Pass held: nothing
finish-if-event
delkeyitem PsoxjaPass                   # a GM
trade Ghebi_Damomohe CarmineChip x2     # two chips: nothing
finish-if-event
trade Ghebi_Damomohe FilthyGnoleClaw x1 # another item: nothing
finish-if-event
trade Ghebi_Damomohe CyanChip x1        # 52
finish                                  # the Pass, Status 3
delkeyitem PsoxjaPass                   # a GM
charvar Mission[6][358]Status 2         # a GM
trade Ghebi_Damomohe GrayChip x1        # 52
finish                                  # Status 3
